estimated_positions.description:
Estimate motor positions from calibrated movement time. This bed cannot report its position, so the values are estimates, not measurements.

Choose the motors to estimate.{not_offered}

Estimates drift with load and after many short moves. Moves made with the remote or the bed's app are not seen. After a restart you confirm the position before saved positions work. Clear every motor to turn estimated positions off.

