init.description:
**{name}** was set up before these app profiles existed and uses {current}. If you control the bed with one of these apps, its profile follows that app's controls:
{apps}

A newly available app profile is not necessarily a better match and may expose fewer controls. Choose one only if you use that app and want its controls; otherwise keep the current configuration. If you keep it, you are asked again only when a new app becomes available for this setup. Your existing device and matching entity IDs are preserved.

unpair.description:
**{name}** is a Dual Bed. An app belongs to one physical bed, so the combined bed cannot switch to it. If you control the beds with one of these apps:
{apps}

open **Configure** on **{name}** and choose **Separate into two beds** (or **Remove Left, Right and Both controls**). Each bed then gets its own review. This repair stays open until then, unless you keep the current setup.

managed.description:
**{name}** uses {current}. If you control it with one of these apps, its controls can follow that app:
{apps}

The guided change checks the bed and lists the control changes before anything is saved. A paired bed must first be split explicitly. This repair stays open until you apply a change or keep the current setup.

