retyped_entities.description:
Some of {bed}'s controls changed type or options in this version. These automations and scripts still use them the old way:

{entities}

Edit each one to use the new entity or its new options. An under-bed light is now a light, so use the light actions instead of the switch actions. Then ignore this message.

removed_entities.description:
{bed} no longer has some of the controls these automations and scripts use, so those steps fail when they run:

{entities}

Most of these controls are now part of another entity, for example several timer buttons became one timer select. Select **Learn more** to see what replaced each one, then edit each automation and script; this message goes away when Home Assistant next starts without finding one.

removed_actions.description:
These automations and scripts call Adjustable Bed actions, fields or options that this version no longer has, so those steps fail when they run:

{calls}

After an arrow is what to use instead. For a line without one, select **Learn more** to see what replaces it. Edit each automation and script; this message goes away when Home Assistant next starts without finding one.
